  "about": {
    "description": "At Scuttlebutt Pub & Cocktails, no one is a stranger. Opened in 2005, the establishment derives its name from the Navy term for rumors and gossip. Owned by Marti and Daniel since November 2021, the pub has transformed from a humble 7-bottle liquor inventory to an impressive collection of over 257 bottles including tequila, bourbon, whiskey, scotch, and vodka. The pub specializes in tiki-style drinks and classic old fashioneds.",
